[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉、汉娜三人一个激灵，<br>抬起了头。|#0101Adv34_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:是钟声……|#0101Adv34_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道说……|#0101Adv34_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

