[PrintTextModified Text:『魔女审判即将开始』|#0101Adv34_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『请大家务必带好自己的手机，<br>　迅速到审判庭集合』|#0101Adv34_Narrative005|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『如有不遵守者，将由看守强制带走』<br>|#0101Adv34_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长传来的信息<br>和预想中的一样。|#0101Adv34_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（到时间了……）|#0101Adv34_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:只好过去了呢。|#0101Adv34_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉摊开双手耸了耸肩。<br>艾玛和汉娜不情不愿地点了点头，开始在过道上移动。|#0101Adv34_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

