[PrintTextModified Text:她们数次探索这座监牢，<br>但因为上锁，从未踏足过这个大房间——|#0101Adv34_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而这间大房间，就是审判庭。|#0101Adv34_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和大厅一样宽阔的室内，中心有一个耐人寻味的底座。<br>十数个证人席绕着底座围成了一圈。|#0101Adv34_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:证人席上标记有各自的囚犯编号，<br>每个人的座位都已分配好了。|#0101Adv34_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而出入口大门处，<br>看守正在站岗放哨。|#0101Adv34_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此时，典狱长站在高处的栏杆上，<br>开口说道。|#0101Adv34_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……首先我要说明一下<br>魔女审判的规则。|#0101Adv34_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:经过1小时的辩论之后，<br>我会请各位用你们的手机投票，选出你们心中认定的凶手。|#0101Adv34_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而在投票中被选为魔女的人物，<br>会被带到中间的底座处，执行处刑……大概就这样。|#0101Adv34_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:11位少女站在证人席上，<br>彼此试探着，向对方投去尖锐的视线。|#0101Adv34_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（必须要选出一位魔女……<br>　可凶手究竟是谁……？）|#0101Adv34_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:一小时都用不着。<br>赶紧投票赶紧结束吧！|#0101Adv34_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，那你愿不愿意自告奋勇<br>说自己就是凶手呢？|#0101Adv34_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来，这事很快就可以结束了。|#0101Adv34_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……人不是我杀的。你要怀疑随便你，<br>但不是我的杀人黑锅，我可不打算背！|#0101Adv34_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哈，我看你就是一副杀过好几个人的样子欸～？<br>其实人就是你杀的吧～？|#0101Adv34_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要不要把票投给亚里沙呢～|#0101Adv34_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙……|#0101Adv34_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们很快便火星四溅起来，<br>令艾玛感到有些退缩。|#0101Adv34_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（让我在这种气氛下发言，<br>　我做不到……）|#0101Adv34_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛低着头，视线无处安放。<br>这时，她看见了旁边的梅露露。|#0101Adv34_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露一副要哭出来的表情。<br>她脸色苍白，身体颤抖着，看着非常害怕这个充满火药味的气氛。|#0101Adv34_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜……大家好可怕……|#0101Adv34_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（梅露露也觉得很害怕）|#0101Adv34_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，没事的。<br>我们要相信彼此，互相加油。|#0101Adv34_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小声地送去鼓励的话语，<br>此时梅露露终于回过神来，抬起了头。|#0101Adv34_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯……谢谢你，艾玛小姐。|#0101Adv34_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在这种时候就没法提起坚定的自信心……<br>肯定没法作出有意义的发言……|#0101Adv34_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，<br>请让我在一旁支援你吧，艾玛小姐……！|#0101Adv34_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你！|#0101Adv34_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛得到了一位近在身边的可靠盟友。她的眼里生出一道希望之光。|#0101Adv34_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我不会认输的！我一定要找出凶手！）|#0101Adv34_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭！|#0101Adv34_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

